q3.zip`\n- Build tag: `MX2-ES-WV4.01-20250619`\n- Build date: 2025-06-19\n\n## Install\n\n1. Download `rom_q3.zip` (every numbered volume if the release has more than one, then `cat rom_q3.zip.* > rom_q3.zip`).\n2. Unzip it. Keep the scatter file next to the images.\n3. Open SP Flash Tool, choose **Download Only**, load the scatter file from the archive and flash.\n4. Or use Innioasis Updater CE: <https://innioasis.app/guide.html>\n\nThis wipes the player. Back up music and recordings first.\n\n## Files\n\n| File | Size |\n| --- | --- |\n| `rom_q3.zip` | 269.0 MB |\n| `SHA256SUMS` | 0.0 MB |\n\nFull archive: <https://innioasis.app/firmware.html?model=Q3>\n\n<!-- portable-mirror:{\"assets\":[{\"model\":\"Q3\",\"name\":\"rom_q3-windows.zip\",\"platform\":\"windows\",\"sha256\":\"db4b276c245e81259801a813b156294596182cd8936540c55c5fe26144c276e4\",\"size\":521712315,\"source_asset\":\"rom_q3.zip\",\"type\":\"Stock\"},{\"model\":\"Q3\",\"name\":\"rom_q3-linux.zip\",\"platform\":\"linux\",\"sha256\":\"e3797f907fe7ca6ea34e8582bc4304d0b52bc37dfe16f4385837d86d80beff09\",\"size\":645583831,\"source_asset\":\"rom_q3.zip\",\"type\":\"Stock\"},{\"model\":\"Q3\",\"name\":\"rom_q3-linux-arm64.zip\",\"platform\":\"linux-arm64\",\"sha256\":\"650be41f4e2ed915ed7da02091b967315194e54cb898e2848b677785f49bc68c\",\"size\":470488773,\"source_asset\":\"rom_q3.zip\",\"type\":\"Stock\"},{\"model\":\"Q3\",\"name\":\"rom_q3-macos.zip\",\"platform\":\"macos\",\"sha256\":\"157d1773fcc9b72aca7271905ac2123041c78117e15955c6b592706966c11806\",\"size\":405434636,\"source_asset\":\"rom_q3.zip\",\"type\":\"Stock\"}],\"built_at\":\"2026-11-11T01:32:28Z\",\"button_assets\":[{\"name\":\"release-button-updater.svg\",\"size\":1540},{\"name\":\"release-button-windows.svg\",\"size\":1522},{\"name\":\"release-button-linux.svg\",\"size\":1518},{\"name\":\"release-button-linux-arm64.svg\",\"size\":1510},{\"name\":\"release-button-macos.svg\",\"size\":1516}],\"failures\":[],\"fingerprint\":\"4702880bd632919804eecc0